  "content": "\n\n<h2>ClaimPoints</h2>\n<p>整合了 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252f1bokaNcj\" rel=\"nofollow\">Xaero's Minimap</a> 與\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fO4o4mKaq\" rel=\"nofollow\">GriefPrevention</a> 伺服器插件，讓玩家能夠透過航點半自動追蹤領地。</p>\n<h3>關於</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>在遊戲內輸入 <code>/cp help</code> 以查看指令資訊。</li>\n</ul>\n<table style=\"width:100%\">\n  <tr>\n    <td style=\"width:50%\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/TerminalMC/ClaimPoints/HEAD/assets/images/showcase/chat_01.png\" style=\"width:100%\"></td>\n    <td style=\"width:50%\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/TerminalMC/ClaimPoints/HEAD/assets/images/showcase/config_01.png\" style=\"width:100%\"></td>\n  </tr>\n</table>\n<h4>依賴項目</h4>\n<p>Fabric：<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252f1bokaNcj\" rel=\"nofollow\">Xaero's Minimap</a>、<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fP7dR8mSH\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fabric API</a>、<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fmOgUt4GM\" rel=\"nofollow\">ModMenu</a>、<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252f9s6osm5g\" rel=\"nofollow\">Cloth Config API</a></p>\n<p>NeoForge：<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252f1bokaNcj\" rel=\"nofollow\">Xaero's Minimap</a>、<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252f9s6osm5g\" rel=\"nofollow\">Cloth Config API</a></p>\n<h3>授權條款</h3>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.apache.org%252flicenses%252fLICENSE-2.0\" rel=\"nofollow\">Apache-2.0</a></p>\n<h3>聯絡方式</h3>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.terminalmc.dev%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/1103153365216669797?logo=discord&label=Discord Server&color=#5865F2\" alt=\"Discord 伺服器\"></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://github.com/TerminalMC/ClaimPoints/issues\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/github/issues/TerminalMC/ClaimPoints?logo=github&label=GitHub Issues\" alt=\"GitHub 問題回報\"></a></p>",
